lder Courses\",\"Youtube videos, Practice Exams\"]","Experience":"I was able to pass my certification because of my family's support and my eagerness to learn. Since I'm still new to the company and to cloud technology, I challenged myself to gain as much knowledge as I could.\n\nWhile I don't have extensive hands-on experience with AWS yet, I'm very willing to learn and improve so I can keep up with the people I work with on different projects. To prepare for the certification, I spent a lot of time watching YouTube videos about AWS Cloud Practitioner topics and checking my understanding through practice exams. I stayed consistent with my study routine, and all the effort paid off when I passed the certification.","Points":20.0,"SubmittedAt":"2026-09-04","Modified":"2026-09-04T23:29:40Z","Created":"2026-09-04T23:29:40Z","Author":{"@odata.type":"#Microsoft.Azure.Connectors.SharePoint.SPListExpandedUser","Claims":"i:0#.f|membership|yuching.wu@ecloudvalley.com","DisplayName":"Summer Wu (吳予淨)","Email":"yuching.wu@ecloudvalley.com","Picture":"https://ecvcorp.sharepoint.com/sites/GMO/_layouts/15/UserPhoto.aspx?Size=L&AccountName=yuching.wu@ecloudvalley.com","Department":"Country Alliance & Program","JobTitle":null},"Author#Claims":"i:0#.f|membership|yuching.wu@ecloudvalley.com","Editor":{"@odata.type":"#Microsoft.Azure.Connectors.SharePoint.SPListExpandedUser","Claims":"i:0#.f|membership|yuching.wu@ecloudvalley.com","DisplayName":"Summer Wu (吳予淨)","Email":"yuching.wu@ecloudvalley.com","Picture":"https://ecvcorp.sharepoint.com/sites/GMO/_layouts/15/UserPhoto.aspx?Size=L&AccountName=yuching.wu@ecloudvalley.com","Department":"Country Alliance & Program","JobTitle":null},"Editor#Claims":"i:0#.f|membership|yuching.wu@ecloudvalley.com","{Identifier}":"Lists%252fExperience_Sharing%252f3_.000","{IsFolder}":false,"{Link}":"https://ecvcorp.sharepoint.com/sites/GMO/_layouts/15/listform.aspx?PageType=4&ListId=6c84098c%2Ddcd1%2D42dc%2Da434%2D2da9f064d436&ID=3&ContentTypeID=0x010023888752B7EDD745B447C7D2498F71B00023EB8A6744E2C144B942206BF0EBE054","{Name}":"","{FilenameWithExtension}":"","{Path}":"Lists/Experience_Sharing/","{FullPath}":"Lists/Experience_Sharing/3_.000","{ContentType}":{"@odata.type":"#Microsoft.Azure.Connectors.SharePoint.SPListExpandedContentType","Id":"0x010023888752B7EDD745B447C7D2498F71B00023EB8A6744E2C144B942206BF0EBE054","Name":"項目"},"{ContentType}#Id":"0x010023888752B7EDD745B447C7D2498F71B00023EB8A6744E2C144B942206BF0EBE054","{HasAttachments}":false,"{VersionNumber}":"1.0"},{"@odata.etag":"\"1\"","ItemInternalId":"4","ID":4,"EmployeeName":"Surya Prabhu Sripal","Email":"surya.prabhu@ecloudvalley.com","Region":"SG","EmployeeNo":"ES040","CertName":"AWS Certified Advanced Networking - Specialty","TopResource":"[\"Vouchers provided by AWS Cloud Team\",\"Program Incentives \",\"Udemy Access\"]","Experience":"First, I took a practice exam on Udemy to identify my weak areas. Based on the results, I focused my preparation on those topics and spent the next two weeks strengthening my knowledge.\n\nAfter two weeks, I retook the practice exam and was able to pass it. To further validate my preparation, I used Gemini to generate additional quizzes and completed five different practice papers.\n\nThis approach helped me identify my knowledge gaps, focus on the areas that needed improvement, and build confidence before taking the actual certification exam.\n\nI also published the practice papers on GitHub so that others preparing for the AWS Networking Specialty certification can use them for their own practice.\n\nhttps://github.com/ssurya-1691/aws-networking-speciality-certification-practice","Points":20.0,"SubmittedAt":"2026-09-07","Modified":"2026-09-07T04:42:01Z","Created":"2026-09-07T04:42:01Z","Author":{"@odata.type":"#Microsoft.Azure.Connectors.SharePoint.SPListExpandedUser","Claims":"i:0#.f|membership|yuching.wu@ecloudvalley.com","DisplayName":"Summer Wu (吳予淨)","Email":"yuching.wu@ecloudvalley.com","Picture":"https://ecvcorp.sh